@display("std/apis")
apis: component(path = "std/apis", lang = "heron") {
  | The [extension point](#language.interop.declaring.extension_point) transports implement, so a new protocol is bound with `js(…)` and needs no new build.
  |
  | Its surface is declared in `std/apis/package.heron`, whose types the API
  | reference renders; each export is specified where its behaviour is:
  |
  | | Export                               | Specified in                                              |
  | | ------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------- |
  | | `Transport`, `Response`, `transport` | [Transports](#language.apis.transports.transport_binding) |

  uses = [language.std.types]
}
